msgstr "2 krimp priključka za baterijski paket (opcionalno)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:57
msgid "1 header for battery pack (optional)"
msgstr "1 header za baterijski paket (opcionalno)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:59
msgid "We used the following tools:"
msgstr "Koristili smo sljedeće alate:"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:61
msgid "Hot Glue Gun"
msgstr "Pištolj za vruće ljepilo"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:62
msgid "Philips Screw Driver"
msgstr "Philips odvijač"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:63
msgid "Cutters (for cutting chopsticks)"
msgstr "Kliješta (za rezanje štapića)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:64
msgid "Soldering Iron (if battery pack needs header)"
msgstr "Lemilica (ako baterijski paket treba header)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:66
msgid "**Step 1: Glue the Two Full Sized Servos Together**"
msgstr "**Korak 1: Zalijepite dva servo motora pune veličine zajedno**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:68
msgid ""
"In the picture, the servo wires have been shortened. You can do this if you "
"like, but it is just as easy to tie them up when you are done."
msgstr ""
"Na slici su servo žice skraćene. To možete učiniti ako želite, ali ih je "
"jednako lako svezati kada završite."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:71
msgid "**Step 2: Glue the servos to the battery case**"
msgstr "**Korak 2: Zalijepite servo motore na kućište baterije**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:73
msgid ""
"Radioshack battery pack shown above. For Acroname battery pack, mount such "
"that AA batteries face up."
msgstr ""
"Radioshack baterijski paket prikazan gore. Za Acroname baterijski paket, "
"montirajte tako da AA baterije budu okrenute prema gore."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:76
msgid "**Step 3: Attach Servo Horns as Wheel Base Connection**"
msgstr "**Korak 3: Pričvrstite servo krakove kao spoj s bazom kotača**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:78
msgid ""
"This step may not be required if you have wheels that directly connect to "
"servos."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj korak možda neće biti potreban ako imate kotače koji se izravno spajaju"
" na servo motore."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:80
msgid "**Step 4: Glue Wheels to Servo Horns**"
msgstr "**Korak 4: Zalijepite kotače na servo krakove**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:82
msgid ""
"Again, this may not be required if you have wheels with direct servo "
"connections."
msgstr ""
"Opet, ovo možda neće biti potrebno ako imate kotače s izravnim servo "
"spojevima."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:84
msgid "**Step 5: Glue Micro-Servo to Base**"
msgstr "**Korak 5: Zalijepite mikro-servo na bazu**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:86
msgid "**Step 6: Glue Micro-Servo Horn to Cut Spoon**"
msgstr "**Korak 6: Zalijepite krak mikro-servo motora na izrezanu žlicu**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:88
msgid ""
"In this step, you must glue the micro-servo horn onto the spoon. Make sure "
"you note the orientation of the servo horn when connected to the spoon. This"
" needs to be able to connect to the servo with the smooth part of the spoon "
"facing down."
msgstr ""
"U ovom koraku morate zalijepiti krak mikro-servo motora na žlicu. Pazite da "
"zabilježite orijentaciju servo kraka kada je spojen na žlicu. On se mora "
"moći spojiti na servo motor s glatkim dijelom žlice okrenutim prema dolje."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:92
msgid ""
"First, tack the horn in place with a small amount of glue. Once it is "
"secure, liberally apply glue and let dry making a strong connection."
msgstr ""
"Prvo pričvrstite krak na mjesto malom količinom ljepila. Kada je učvršćen, "
"obilno nanesite ljepilo i ostavite da se osuši stvarajući čvrst spoj."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:95
msgid "**Step 7: Calibrate Micro-Servo Position and Attach Spoon**"
msgstr ""
"**Korak 7: Kalibrirajte položaj mikro-servo motora i pričvrstite žlicu**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:97
msgid ""
"Before connecting the servo horn with the spoon to the micro-servo, it is "
"important to calibrate the servo position. This can be done by loading the "
"CMUcam2 emulation firmware and then using the CMUcam3 Frame Grabber program."
" You can also use the SV servo command from a terminal program. Set the "
"servo to the most extreme direction that would correspond to the spoon being"
" placed in the lowest position. For our servo, this was servo value 255. In "
"this position, it should not be possible for the spoon to push back against "
"the base of the spoonBot."
msgstr ""
"Prije spajanja servo kraka sa žlicom na mikro-servo, važno je kalibrirati "
"položaj servo motora. To se može učiniti učitavanjem firmvera za emulaciju "
"CMUcam2, a zatim korištenjem programa CMUcam3 Frame Grabber. Također možete "
"koristiti SV servo naredbu iz terminalskog programa. Postavite servo motor u"
" najekstremniji smjer koji bi odgovarao žlici postavljenoj u najniži "
"položaj. Za naš servo motor to je bila vrijednost servo motora 255. U ovom "
"položaju ne bi trebalo biti moguće da žlica gurne natrag prema bazi "
"spoonBota."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:105
msgid ""
"Note, you may need to connect the external servo power jumper if it is not "
"already installed."
msgstr ""
"Napomena: možda ćete morati spojiti vanjski jumper za napajanje servo motora"
" ako već nije postavljen."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:108
msgid ""
"See :doc:`hardware-power <hardware-power>` for more details on servo power "
"jumper."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte :doc:`hardware-power <hardware-power>` za više pojedinosti o "
"jumperu za napajanje servo motora."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:110
msgid ""
"See :doc:`hardware-servo <hardware-servo>` for information on connecting "
"servos. The black wire should connect to the ground pin."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte :doc:`hardware-servo <hardware-servo>` za informacije o spajanju "
"servo motora. Crna žica trebala bi se spojiti na pin uzemljenja."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:113
msgid "**Step 8: Glue Two Chopstick Posts**"
msgstr "**Korak 8: Zalijepite dva nosača za štapiće**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:115
msgid "**Step 9: Trim Chopsticks and Glue on Top Crossbar**"
msgstr "**Korak 9: Skratite štapiće i zalijepite gornju poprečnu gredu**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:117
msgid "**Step 10: Attach CMUcam3**"
msgstr "**Korak 10: Pričvrstite CMUcam3**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:119
msgid ""
"Liberally glue the CMUcam3 to the top chopstick bar. We used glue on both "
"sides to make sure it was secure."
msgstr ""
"Obilno zalijepite CMUcam3 na gornju gredu od štapića. Koristili smo ljepilo "
"s obje strane kako bismo bili sigurni da je učvršćeno."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:122
msgid "**Step 11: Connect Power and Servo Wires**"
msgstr "**Korak 11: Spojite žice napajanja i servo motora**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:124
msgid "Connect the right wheel servo (as viewed from front) to Servo Port 0."
msgstr "Spojite servo desnog kotača (gledano sprijeda) na Servo Port 0."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:125
msgid "Connect the left wheel servo to Servo Port 1."
msgstr "Spojite servo lijevog kotača na Servo Port 1."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:126
msgid "Connect the spoon actuation servo to Servo Port 2."
msgstr "Spojite servo za pokretanje žlice na Servo Port 2."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:127
msgid "See :doc:`hardware-servo <hardware-servo>` for servo port numbers."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte :doc:`hardware-servo <hardware-servo>` za brojeve servo "
"priključaka."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:129
msgid "Next step: :doc:`Run the spoonBot Firmware <spoonbot-demo>`"
msgstr "Sljedeći korak: :doc:`Pokrenite firmware spoonBota <spoonbot-demo>`"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/spoonbot.rst:131
msgid ""
"**Note: Unless you have the RadioShack battery pack with the off switch, "
"remember to unplug spoonBot when it is off. The servos will slowly drain the"
" battery otherwise.**"
msgstr ""
"**Napomena: Osim ako nemate RadioShack baterijski paket s prekidačem za "
"isključivanje, ne zaboravite iskopčati spoonBot kada je isključen. Inače će "
"servo motori polako prazniti bateriju.**"
